    <div class="tag">OFFICIAL DUCK ESPORTS COMMUNITY</div>

    <h1>WELCOME TO<br><span>DUK LEAGUE</span></h1>

    <p>
        A community built on skill, chaos, teamwork and ducks.
        Join the league. Make your name legendary.
    </p>

    <button class="btn" onclick="openJoin()">JOIN THE LEAGUE</button>
</section>

<section id="ranks">
    <h2 class="section-title">THE <span>RANKS</span></h2>

    <p class="subtitle">
